								<div class="mobile-core-icon"><i class="fas fa-people-arrows"></i></div>
								<div class="mobile-core-title">Transformative</div>
								<div class="mobile-core-desc">Shaping aspiring learners into globally competitive professionals.</div>
							</div>

							<div class="mobile-core-card accent-red">
								<div class="mobile-core-icon"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
								<div class="mobile-core-title">Collaborative</div>
								<div class="mobile-core-desc">Partnering with leading institutions for practical education.</div>
							</div>

							<div class="mobile-core-card accent-dark">
