		<section
			id="trainers"
			class="trainers"
		>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-title">
					<h2>Our Trainers</h2>
					<p>Learn from industry professionals with years of experience in digital arts and technology.</p>
				</div>

				<!-- First Trainer (Image Left, Text Right) -->
				<div class="trainer-content">
					<div class="trainer-image">
						<img
							src="/assets/images/our-trainers-java.jpg"
							alt="Our Trainers Java"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="trainer-text">
						<h2>For Programming (JAVA) NCIII</h2>
						<p>Our trainer for the Programming (JAVA) NCIII course is a highly qualified Java programming specialist with a Programming (JAVA) NCIII certification and National TVET Trainer Certified status. They are also an Oracle Certified Associate and JAVA SE 8 Programmer, reflecting their exceptional expertise.</p>
						<p>As an experienced industry practitioner and dedicated programmer/web developer, they bring valuable insights to their role. With years in teaching, they are committed to sharing their extensive knowledge and skills with aspiring programmers.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Second Trainer -->
				<div class="trainer-content reverse">
					<div class="trainer-image">
						<img
							src="/assets/images/our-goal.jpg"
							alt="Our Goal"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="trainer-text">
						<h2>Our Goal</h2>
						<p>Our institution is committed to nurturing student growth through a comprehensive educational experience. We strive to impart extensive knowledge and enhance both theoretical and practical skills. By emphasizing upskilling and utilizing industry practitioners' expertise, we ensure a relevant and innovative curriculum.</p>
						<p>Our primary goal is to prepare students for employment opportunities post-graduation, equipping them with the essential competencies to succeed in their chosen fields.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

